<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-057-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) Fig. 403: Dwight human scapulae coordinate transformation — MorphoEval overall 68.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1. Three Fig. 403 silhouettes segmented; TPS from A (Caucasian) to B and C. A→B outline Procrustes 0.177 vs identity 0.262, IoU 0.808 vs 0.715. A→C outline TPS slightly worse than identity (0.300 vs 0.275; IoU 0.612 vs 0.672). Verdict mixed. Overall 68.6/100 (faithfulness 64.1, reproducibility 79.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit a8bae15d5; environment: python 3.12. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 72, Morphological realism / specimen match 68, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 58, Source and data traceability 86, Code-to-model traceability 78, Reproducibility package 74. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_057_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-057_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py at a8bae15d5, image/png, 148102 B, 1440×960 px, artifact_sha256 948ac31a2b981fe36c648699423b73b2bc2dce9fd28da7aae5df05270d46963f (sha256 948ac31a2b981fe36c648699423b73b2bc2dce9fd28da7aae5df05270d46963f), spec_fingerprint 623b1de0b4ed7c847d9d960d4ae952198b27d7e7df34ef7cfb25eedd8e1212f4. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 623b1de0b4ed7c847d9d960d4ae952198b27d7e7df34ef7cfb25eedd8e1212f4; artifact_sha256: 948ac31a2b981fe36c648699423b73b2bc2dce9fd28da7aae5df05270d46963f; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-057/ongrowthform1917thom_p769_leaf0788_fig403.jpg=7c57adb9fe06c75c..., datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-057/t1917_057_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_reference.json=f3c362f5577ce294..., morphoeval/lean/loops/Thompson1917_T1917_057.lean=d4758b591418639c...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Fig. 403 three human scapulae with coordinate grids (Dwight); reconstructed_in_script: TPS on automatic border extrema + semilandmarks; not Thompson's drawn grid lines; does_not_claim: Population-level variation within race (Thompson footnote); Dryad kangaroo-rat dataset." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Add KS test and report parameter sweep CV in measure_morphoeval'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Expand specimen CV on Commons scapula; document A→C outline failure mode'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.86e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

